OL,5,Asecretary of state
OL,6,
OL,7,FA large cordon remains in place near
OL,8,Fthe base while 85 households, evacuated
OL,9,Fon Sunday, have been told by
OL,10,FGloucestershire Police they can return
OL,11,Fhome
